# Citation metadata for the VSP Recalibration Pipeline.
# https://citation-file-format.github.io/
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "VSP Recalibration Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Photometric recalibration pipeline for the VSP / ROTSE-1 / ROTSE-III
  variable-star surveys. Cross-matches ROTSE detections against the
  PanSTARRS DR2 reference catalog, fits per-exposure pseudo-bolometric
  slope and AB-offset corrections, and produces calibrated light curves
  for individual targets.
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
